  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-race-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-race-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-race-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>1002-5</td><td>Native American, Alaska Native, or Indigenous</td></tr><tr><td>2028-9</td><td>Asian</td></tr><tr><td>2054-5</td><td>Black, African or African American</td></tr><tr><td>2118-8</td><td>Middle Eastern or North African</td></tr><tr><td>2076-8</td><td>Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander</td></tr><tr><td>2106-3</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>2131-1</td><td>Hispanic or Latino/a/e</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
  ] ; # 
